{
  "149.csv::295": {
    "id": "149.csv::295",
    "source_text": "フフフフ――\nついに――\nついにこの時が来たわ！",
    "translated_text": "Hehehe—\nAt last—\nAt last this moment has come!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:27:30.431018",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:33:32.242517",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 295,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::296": {
    "id": "149.csv::296",
    "source_text": "今日はピレモスの人たちへの\n素敵なサプライズを用意してるの！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ve got a lovely surprise ready for the folk of Piremoth today!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:27:41.380563",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:33:57.587853",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 296,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::297": {
    "id": "149.csv::297",
    "source_text": "ローナとの共同作戦よ\nもちろん、あなたも手伝ってくれるよね？",
    "translated_text": "It&#x27;s a joint operation with Lorna!\nCourse you&#x27;ll help out too, right?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:27:56.532346",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:34:28.500627",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 297,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::298": {
    "id": "149.csv::298",
    "source_text": "そうこなくっちゃね！",
    "translated_text": "That&#x27;s the spirit!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:28:14.823344",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:34:37.642556",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 298,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::299": {
    "id": "149.csv::299",
    "source_text": "何を用意してるかは\n現地へ行ってからのお楽しみ！",
    "translated_text": "What I&#x27;ve prepared&#x27;s a surprise for when we reach the site!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:28:34.301765",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:34:45.276668",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 299,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::300": {
    "id": "149.csv::300",
    "source_text": "準備できたら声かけて！",
    "translated_text": "Give me a shout when you&#x27;re ready!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:28:44.093191",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:34:49.870425",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 300,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::301": {
    "id": "149.csv::301",
    "source_text": "フフフフ――\n何を用意してるかは\nピレモスについてからのお楽しみ！",
    "translated_text": "Hehehe... What I&#x27;m preparin&#x27;s a surprise for when we reach Piremoth!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:29:14.053128",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:35:03.511451",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 301,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::302": {
    "id": "149.csv::302",
    "source_text": "気になってしかたないって顔ね！\nそれじゃ、出発といきますか",
    "translated_text": "That&#x27;s the &quot;I just gotta know&quot; face! Well then, shall we be off?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:29:37.742950",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:35:26.198543",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 302,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::303": {
    "id": "149.csv::303",
    "source_text": "出発する",
    "translated_text": "Let&#x27;s set out!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:35:37.904576",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:35:37.906334",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 303,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::304": {
    "id": "149.csv::304",
    "source_text": "――少し待ってほしい",
    "translated_text": "—Wait a moment.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:36:38.643546",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:36:38.645749",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 304,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::305": {
    "id": "149.csv::305",
    "source_text": "よーし、はりきって行くよ\nピレモスに向かって出発！",
    "translated_text": "Right then, I&#x27;m raring to go! Setting out for Piremoth!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:36:55.944620",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:36:55.946271",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 305,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::306": {
    "id": "149.csv::306",
    "source_text": "アタシは準備できてるから\nいつでも声かけてね！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;m ready, so give me a shout any time!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:37:25.372275",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:37:25.374084",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 306,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::307": {
    "id": "149.csv::307",
    "source_text": "ピレモスのみんなの驚く顔\n早く見たいなぁ",
    "translated_text": "Can&#x27;t wait to see the surprised faces of everyone in Piremoth",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:37:35.632280",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:37:35.634236",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 307,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::308": {
    "id": "149.csv::308",
    "source_text": "い――\nいない！",
    "translated_text": "Th-they&#x27;re--  \nGone!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:37:44.666924",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:37:44.669943",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 308,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::309": {
    "id": "149.csv::309",
    "source_text": "あの子たちが！\nどこにもいない！\n――そ、そんな――",
    "translated_text": "Those kids!\nThey&#x27;re nowhere to be found!\nN-no... that can&#x27;t be--",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:08.817917",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:08.820015",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 309,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::310": {
    "id": "149.csv::310",
    "source_text": "ローナについて聞く",
    "translated_text": "Ask about Lorna",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:11.526616",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:11.528388",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 310,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::311": {
    "id": "149.csv::311",
    "source_text": "&quot;あの子たち&quot;について聞く",
    "translated_text": "Ask about &quot;those kids&quot;",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:19.460482",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:19.462183",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 311,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::312": {
    "id": "149.csv::312",
    "source_text": "そ――そうだ\nローナもいない――",
    "translated_text": "Th-that&#x27;s right... Lorna&#x27;s not here either—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:41.523004",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:38:41.525136",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 312,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::313": {
    "id": "149.csv::313",
    "source_text": "もしかしたら――\n何かあって、追いかけてったのかも",
    "translated_text": "Perhaps— Something happened, and they went chasing after it.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:39:15.451077",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:39:15.454258",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 313,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::314": {
    "id": "149.csv::314",
    "source_text": "そ、そうね\nまだあきらめるのは早いよね――\nとりあえず、ローナを探そう！",
    "translated_text": "R-right. It&#x27;s too soon to give up— Let&#x27;s find Lorna first!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:39:26.605038",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:39:26.607936",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 314,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::315": {
    "id": "149.csv::315",
    "source_text": "ううう――あの子たち――\n今までずっと大事に育ててきたのに",
    "translated_text": "Uugh... those little ones... I&#x27;ve raised them so carefully all this time.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:40:10.167056",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:40:10.170469",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 315,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::316": {
    "id": "149.csv::316",
    "source_text": "あの子たちにもしものことがあったら\nアタシ――",
    "translated_text": "If anything happens to those kids, I—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:40:26.985266",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:40:26.988636",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 316,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::317": {
    "id": "149.csv::317",
    "source_text": "ああ、どうしよう――",
    "translated_text": "Ah, what am I to do—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:40:52.040098",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:40:52.043136",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 317,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::318": {
    "id": "149.csv::318",
    "source_text": "でかくて黒い鳥ばっかり！\nローナの姿もあの子たちの姿もないし\nなんかものすごく不吉な予感がする――",
    "translated_text": "Nothing but huge black birds!\nNo sign of Lorna, nor those kids either—\nGot a terribly ominous feeling—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:41:47.423350",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:41:47.426790",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 318,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::319": {
    "id": "149.csv::319",
    "source_text": "まだ――まだよ！\nお願い、みんな無事でいて！",
    "translated_text": "Not yet— not yet!\nPlease, everyone, stay safe!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:11.072149",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:11.075324",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 319,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::320": {
    "id": "149.csv::320",
    "source_text": "とにかく\nピレモスの方まで行ってみましょう！",
    "translated_text": "Anyhow, let&#x27;s head on over to Piremoth!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:23.819458",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:23.822966",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 320,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::321": {
    "id": "149.csv::321",
    "source_text": "レーア！　ミディ！　ウェルダ！",
    "translated_text": "Rhea! Midi! Welda!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:27.014069",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:27.017623",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 321,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::322": {
    "id": "149.csv::322",
    "source_text": "いやぁ、さっすが\n名ハンター、ローナ！\nちゃんと３匹とも見つけてくれてたのね！",
    "translated_text": "Wow, just as expected of the master hunter, Lorna! You really did find all three!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:57.318052",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:42:57.321373",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 322,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::323": {
    "id": "149.csv::323",
    "source_text": "アタシの豚さん、みんな無事だった！\nああ、安心した――！",
    "translated_text": "My pigs are all safe!\nOh, what a relief—!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:43:18.640269",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:43:18.643718",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 323,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::324": {
    "id": "149.csv::324",
    "source_text": "豚について聞く",
    "translated_text": "Ask about the pig",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:43:31.629474",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:43:31.632905",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 324,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::325": {
    "id": "149.csv::325",
    "source_text": "ローナについて聞く",
    "translated_text": "Ask about Lorna",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:43:31.640504",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:43:31.644297",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 325,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::326": {
    "id": "149.csv::326",
    "source_text": "丘で見つけた\nかわいい豚さんたち！",
    "translated_text": "Found &#x27;em on the hill! Cute little piggies!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:44:06.184682",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:44:06.188330",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 326,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::327": {
    "id": "149.csv::327",
    "source_text": "この日のために\nローナと二人で\n命がけで育てたんだから！",
    "translated_text": "For this day, Lorna and I raised &#x27;em with our lives on the line!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:44:18.276414",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:44:18.280990",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 327,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::328": {
    "id": "149.csv::328",
    "source_text": "ピレモスの人たちに\n新鮮なお肉を食べてもらいたくってね",
    "translated_text": "Want the folk of Piremoth to taste some fresh meat.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:44:41.628366",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:44:41.631886",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 328,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::329": {
    "id": "149.csv::329",
    "source_text": "いやーこの完成度――\n見てるだけでほっぺが落ちそうだね！",
    "translated_text": "My my, this quality—just looking at it makes my cheeks fall clean off!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:29.759617",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:29.763805",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 329,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::330": {
    "id": "149.csv::330",
    "source_text": "さて、この子たちのことはローナに任せて\nアタシたちはピレモスへ向かおうか！",
    "translated_text": "Right then, let&#x27;s leave these little ones to Lorna and make for Piremoth!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:51.404813",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:45:51.408453",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 330,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::331": {
    "id": "149.csv::331",
    "source_text": "この子たちを丘で見つけてから\nローナと一緒にずっとごはんあげてたんだ！",
    "translated_text": "Ever since we found these little ones on the hill, Lorna and I&#x27;ve been feedin&#x27; &#x27;em the whole time!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:46:10.133058",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:46:10.136501",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 331,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::332": {
    "id": "149.csv::332",
    "source_text": "ピレモスの人たちへの贈り物にするって\n言ったら、ローナも大賛成してくれてね\nいわば、二人で仕上げたお肉だよ",
    "translated_text": "When I said I&#x27;d make it a gift for the folk of Piremoth, Lorna strongly agreed, too. &#x27;Tis, in a sense, meat the two of us finished together.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:46:53.763250",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:46:53.767139",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 332,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::333": {
    "id": "149.csv::333",
    "source_text": "さて、この子たちのことはローナに任せて\nアタシたちはピレモスへ向かおうか！",
    "translated_text": "Right then, let&#x27;s leave these little ones to Lorna and make for Piremoth!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:46:53.774664",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:46:53.779166",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 333,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::334": {
    "id": "149.csv::334",
    "source_text": "さすがに活きのいいの\n３匹も追い回すのは骨が折れたよ",
    "translated_text": "&#x27;Twas heavy going, chasing down 3 so lively.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:47:08.220975",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:47:08.225060",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 334,
    "speaker": "Lorna",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::335": {
    "id": "149.csv::335",
    "source_text": "キャリーと一緒にエサをあげてきたんだけど\nこんなにも元気に育つとはね",
    "translated_text": "Carrie and I came to feed them, but &#x27;tis a marvel they&#x27;ve grown so hearty.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:47:54.317715",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:47:54.321339",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 335,
    "speaker": "Lorna",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::336": {
    "id": "149.csv::336",
    "source_text": "さ――\nここは私に任せて\n先にピレモスへ行きなよ",
    "translated_text": "Right then—\nLeave this to me.\nYou head on ahead to Piremoth.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:48:05.551885",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:48:05.555502",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 336,
    "speaker": "Lorna",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::337": {
    "id": "149.csv::337",
    "source_text": "今回でピレモスへの食料も\n十分な量を届けられたかな！",
    "translated_text": "With this, think we&#x27;ve delivered enough food to Piremoth at last!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:48:29.838603",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:48:29.842943",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 337,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::338": {
    "id": "149.csv::338",
    "source_text": "サプライズもよろこんでくれてるし\nなんだかんだで大成功だね！",
    "translated_text": "They&#x27;re delighted by the surprise, too — and after all&#x27;s said and done, a grand success!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:48:53.286944",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:48:53.291114",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 338,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::339": {
    "id": "149.csv::339",
    "source_text": "そうそう\nアンドレアがね\nあなたにもお礼言いたいって！",
    "translated_text": "Oh, right! Andrea — she wants to thank you, too!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:49:16.634906",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:49:16.638986",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 339,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::340": {
    "id": "149.csv::340",
    "source_text": "――本当に、今までありがとう！\nおかげでピレモスも飢えずにいられたわ\nみんな感謝してるのよ",
    "translated_text": "— Truly, thank you for everything! Thanks to you, Piremoth didn&#x27;t go hungry. Everyone&#x27;s grateful.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:49:24.640724",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:49:24.644795",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 340,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::341": {
    "id": "149.csv::341",
    "source_text": "しかもあんなに立派な豚まで――\nワクワクするっていうのかしら\nこんなに心が躍るなんて、久しぶりだわ",
    "translated_text": "And such a fine pig at that—\nIs this what they call excitement?\n&#x27;Tis been an age since my heart leapt so.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:49:45.014087",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:49:45.017997",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 341,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::342": {
    "id": "149.csv::342",
    "source_text": "この状況だから、ピレモスから\n大したお礼はできないんだけど――",
    "translated_text": "Given the situation, Piremoth can&#x27;t offer aught much by way of thanks—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:50:09.324914",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:50:09.328971",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 342,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::343": {
    "id": "149.csv::343",
    "source_text": "先日、前にキャリーから聞いていた\n釜戸の修復に使えそうな\n&lt;COL ff2600&gt;《粘土質の土》&lt;/COL&gt;を手に入れたの",
    "translated_text": "The other day, I came by the &lt;COL ff2600&gt;clay soil&lt;/COL&gt; Carrie&#x27;d mentioned, should serve for the hearth&#x27;s mending.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:50:36.211174",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:50:36.215216",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 343,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::344": {
    "id": "149.csv::344",
    "source_text": "後で、砦に届くように手配しておくわ\n修復に使えるかどうか、一度試してみて！",
    "translated_text": "I&#x27;ll have it sent to the fortress later.\nGive it a try, see if it serves for mending!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:51:14.772951",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:51:14.777066",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 344,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::345": {
    "id": "149.csv::345",
    "source_text": "――私たちも、いつまでも\nここでくすぶってはいられないわよね",
    "translated_text": "— We can&#x27;t stay holed up here forever, can we?",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:51:31.594871",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:51:31.598969",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 345,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::346": {
    "id": "149.csv::346",
    "source_text": "食べるものを食べて力をつけたら\nきっとあなたたちの役に――\nこの国の復興のために力を尽くすわ",
    "translated_text": "Once they&#x27;ve eaten and built their strength,\nthey&#x27;ll surely serve you well—\nI&#x27;ll devote myself to this land&#x27;s revival.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:01.710912",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:01.715203",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 346,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::347": {
    "id": "149.csv::347",
    "source_text": "――本当に、今までありがとう！\nおかげでピレモスも飢えずにいられたわ\nみんな感謝してるのよ",
    "translated_text": "— Truly, thank you for everything! Thanks to you, Piremoth didn&#x27;t go hungry. Everyone&#x27;s grateful.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:01.727006",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:01.732157",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 347,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::348": {
    "id": "149.csv::348",
    "source_text": "しかもあんなに立派な豚まで――\nワクワクするっていうのかしら\nこんなに心が躍るなんて、久しぶりだわ",
    "translated_text": "And such a fine pig at that—\nIs this what they call excitement?\n&#x27;Tis been an age since my heart leapt so.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:01.743639",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:01.747696",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 348,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::349": {
    "id": "149.csv::349",
    "source_text": "この状況だから、ピレモスとしては\n大したお礼もできないんだけど――",
    "translated_text": "With things as they are, Piremoth can&#x27;t offer aught by way of thanks, but—",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:14.871498",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:14.875520",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 349,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::350": {
    "id": "149.csv::350",
    "source_text": "――私たちも、いつまでも\nここでくすぶってはいられないからね",
    "translated_text": "— We can&#x27;t stay cooped up here forever, now.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:38.996952",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:39.000961",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 350,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::351": {
    "id": "149.csv::351",
    "source_text": "食べるものを食べて力をつけたら\nきっとあなたたちの役に――\nこの国の復興のために力を尽くすわ",
    "translated_text": "Once they&#x27;ve eaten and built their strength,\nthey&#x27;ll surely serve you well—\nI&#x27;ll devote myself to this land&#x27;s revival.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:39.010633",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:39.014929",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 351,
    "speaker": "Andrea",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::352": {
    "id": "149.csv::352",
    "source_text": "ピレモスの人たち\nよろこんでくれて良かった！\nアタシでも、頑張ればみんなの力になれるんだ！",
    "translated_text": "The folk of Piremoth — glad they were pleased! Even me, if I give it my all, I can be a strength to everyone!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:52.011418",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:52:52.015684",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 352,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::353": {
    "id": "149.csv::353",
    "source_text": "ちょっとは褒められそうなことできたかな？\nもちろん――ひとりで出来たことじゃないけど",
    "translated_text": "Reckon I managed aught worth a bit of praise?\n&#x27;Course—&#x27;twasn&#x27;t something I did alone, mind.",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:53:07.639606",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:53:07.644152",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 353,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  },
  "149.csv::354": {
    "id": "149.csv::354",
    "source_text": "いま――こうして喜べるのも\nあなたが力を貸してくれたおかげ！",
    "translated_text": "Now—being able to rejoice like this is all thanks to you lending me your strength!",
    "status": "pre-translated",
    "translator": "pretranslate",
    "approver": null,
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:53:24.799599",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-15T22:53:24.804604",
    "approved_at": null,
    "file_path": "C:/DDON-translation/English/Fully Translated\\149.csv",
    "row_index": 354,
    "speaker": "Carrie",
    "entry_type": "Quest Dialogue"
  }
}